{"id":"9a1dfd8bac56a4d9","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-quotation-function.md","title":"Quotation Function","display":"df-quotation-function — Quotation Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-quotation-function","aliases":["90-df-quotation-function"],"display":"df-quotation-function — Quotation Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-godel-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-quotation-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-quotation-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotation-function — Quotation Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (effective signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(E\\in\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span> (syntactic expression)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{quote}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{quote}_g\\)</span> (quotation function, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g\">\\(\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a>；没有省略其定义来源。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotation\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{quote}_g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{quote}_g(E)\\coloneqq g(E)=\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotation\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{quote}_g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{quote}_g(E)\\coloneqq g(E)=\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{quote}(e)\">\\(\\mathrm{quote}(e)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>的引用（Gödel数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner e \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner e \\urcorner\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>的Gödel数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li>将表达式&quot;引用&quot;为数字</li>\n<li>用于构造自引用句子</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-number","status":"resolved","id":"5e705f7962c302c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel numbering, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-number","status":"resolved","id":"5e705f7962c302c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g$ 直接取 [[90-df-godel-number]]；没有省略其定义来源。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner e \\urcorner$ : $e$的Gödel数 (see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{quote}_g","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotation\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{quote}_g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{quote}_g(E)\\coloneqq g(E)=\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{quote}(e)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner e \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false}],"bytes":1274,"backlinks":[{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-number]]、[[90-df-quotation-function]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\n[[90-df-haltseq.md]]\n[[90-df-hbl-conditions.md]]\n[[90-df-henkin-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-hypersimple-set.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-extension.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy.md]]\n[[90-df-kleene-